#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j3-made-official/index.html:0
msgid "The Taifafeki Hep B product matches nothing on the national schedule. The EHR keeps Taifafeki's product coding and adds the schedule coding beside it, from the national map (<0/>). For the Hep B product the map has no entry, so Nurse Chanthason makes the clinical call that it is the schedule's birth dose (<1/>), and her decision is added to the map for the next clinic. The schedule (<2/>) then runs: the birth doses count, and pentavalent 1, bOPV 1 and PCV 1, due at 6 weeks, are overdue at 10 weeks (<3/>), so Nurse Chanthason gives them that day. Khamla leaves with the date of the next doses (<4/>). Over the year Somsak gets the rest of his doses and measles-rubella at 9 months, in Onesa."
msgstr ""

